## Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the **source code** of Peek-a-Piece.

It does **not** cover the bundled media, which are not ours to relicense or
are pictures of real children:

- **Starter puzzle pictures** (`src/games/puzzle/assets/starter/`) — cartoon renders
  of the developer's family photographs. All rights reserved. They ship so the
  app has something to show on first run; they are not licensed for reuse,
  redistribution, or inclusion in a derivative work. Replace them with your
  own if you fork this.
- **Background music** (`resources/the_mountain-children.mp3`) — "Children" by
  Dmitrii Kolesnikov, used under the Pixabay Content License. That licence
  governs it, not this one.
- **The Peek-a-Piece name, logo mark, and icon** (`resources/`) — trademarks
  and brand assets. A fork may use the code; it may not present itself as
  Peek-a-Piece.

Third-party dependencies remain under their own licences; see
[`docs/legal/copyright.md`](docs/legal/copyright.md) for the full attribution
list.
